*Asymptotic Convergence:* Wavefunctions must vanish at infinity ($r -> infinity$) to remain normalizable. When using power series solutions for radial equations, the asymptotic behavior of the infinite series must be analyzed to ensure the wavefunction does not diverge at large distances.
